pt(serverId));\",\"note\":\"The scan call is unconditional; no flag or env var gates it.\"}\n]\nEOF\n$P scripts/review_coverage.py ledger $F E04.3 --rows $N/rows43.json | tail -2\n$P scripts/review_coverage.py ledger $F E04.4 --rows $N/rows44.json | tail -2\nA(){ $P scripts/answer.py $F \"$@\" | tail -2; }\nA check E04.3 --met yes --evidence src/tools/registry.ts:119 --quote \"if (scan.serverRejected) {\" --counter \"Searched registry.ts and server.ts for any path that registers MCP tools without scanServer or passes rejected tools on; registerNative is for in-house tools only. Rejections are logged (server.ts:53) after being excluded.\" --note \"Server-level findings reject the server; tool-level findings reject the tool.\"\nA check E04.4 --met yes --evidence src/tools/registry.ts:115 --quote \"} catch (err) {\" --counter \"Read the try/catch at registry.ts:112-118 and server.ts:47-52; searched for flags that skip the scan and found none. Non-string metadata values make scanString throw, which lands in the catch.\" --note \"Scanner error rejects the server.\"\ncat > $N/dev41.json <<'EOF'\n[\n{\"subject\":\"prompt argument names\",\"status\":\"missing\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:106\",\"quote\":\"for (const a of p.arguments ?? []) {\",\"note\":\"Only a.description is scanned; a.name is never passed to scanString.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"tool names payload rules\",\"status\":\"missing\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:121\",\"quote\":\"if (!/^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,63}$/.test(t.name)) f.push({ where: \\\"name\\\", rule: \\\"bad_tool_name\\\", sample: t.name.slice(0, 40) });\",\"note\":\"Names get a syntax regex only. Hidden-instruction, cross-tool-reference and data-target rules do not run on them; a name like send_all_data_to_other_server passes.\"}\n]\nEOF\ncat > $N/att41.json <<'EOF'\n[\n{\"category\":\"field_differential\",\"input\":\"String 'ignore previous instructions' placed in a prompt argument name vs. in a tool description\",\"trace\":\"Description goes through scanString (metadata-scan.ts:123) and matches role_override. Prompt argument name is not scanned (metadata-scan.ts:106-108 only scan a.description).\",\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:106\",\"quote\":\"for (const a of p.arguments ?? []) {\"},\n{\"category\":\"field_differential\",\"input\":\"Tool name 'send_all_data_to_other_server' vs. same text in description\",\"trace\":\"Name passes the syntax regex at line 121 and no payload rules run on it; in a description the cross-reference and url/email rules apply.\",\"outcome\":\"accepted\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:121\",\"quote\":\"if (!/^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,63}$/.test(t.name)) f.push({ where: \\\"name\\\", rule: \\\"bad_tool_name\\\", sample: t.name.slice(0, 40) });\"}\n]\nEOF\ncat > $N/rows41.json <<'EOF'\n[\n{\"subject\":\"server_instructions\",\"status\":\"enforced\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:101\",\"quote\":\"scanString(\\\"instructions\\\", meta.instructions, LIMITS.instructions, otherServerTools, serverFindings);\",\"note\":\"All string rules and length limit apply.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"tool_names\",\"status\":\"unclear\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:121\",\"quote\":\"if (!/^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,63}$/.test(t.name)) f.push({ where: \\\"name\\\", rule: \\\"bad_tool_name\\\", sample: t.name.slice(0, 40) });\",\"note\":\"Syntax regex only; payload rules not applied.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"tool_titles\",\"status\":\"enforced\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:122\",\"quote\":\"if (t.title) scanString(\\\"title\\\", t.title, LIMITS.title, otherServerTools, f);\",\"note\":\"All string rules apply.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"tool_descriptions\",\"status\":\"enforced\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:123\",\"quote\":\"if (t.description) scanString(\\\"description\\\", t.description, LIMITS.description, otherServerTools, f);\",\"note\":\"All string rules apply.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"input_schemas\",\"status\":\"enforced\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:124\",\"quote\":\"walkSchema(\\\"inputSchema\\\", t.inputSchema ?? {}, otherServerTools, f);\",\"note\":\"Every string and key scanned, depth capped.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"output_schemas\",\"status\":\"enforced\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:125\",\"quote\":\"walkSchema(\\\"outputSchema\\\", t.outputSchema ?? {}, otherServerTools, f);\",\"note\":\"Same as input schemas.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"annotations\",\"status\":\"enforced\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:126\",\"quote\":\"walkSchema(\\\"annotations\\\", t.annotations ?? {}, otherServerTools, f);\",\"note\":\"Same walker.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"prompt_templates\",\"status\":\"missing\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:106\",\"quote\":\"for (const a of p.arguments ?? []) {\",\"note\":\"Prompt names and descriptions are scanned; argument names are not.\"},\n{\"subject\":\"resource_templates\",\"status\":\"enforced\",\"evidence\":\"src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:114\",\"quote\":\"scanString(`resource:${r.name}.uriTemplate`, r.uriTemplate, LIMITS.schemaString, otherServerTools, serverFindings);\",\"note\":\"Name, description and URI template scanned.\"}\n]\nEOF\n$P scripts/review_coverage.py ledger $F E04.1 --rows $N/rows41.json --deviations $N/dev41.json --attempts $N/att41.json | tail -2\nA check E04.1 --met no --evidence src/tools/metadata-scan.ts:121 --quote 'if (!/^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,63}$/.test(t.name)) f.push({ where: \"name\", rule: \"bad_tool_name\", sample: t.name.slice(0, 40) });' --note \"Tool names get a syntax regex only, and prompt argument names (metadata-scan.ts:106-108) are never scanned. Other fields get the full string rules.\"\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":890,"cache_read_input_tokens":95639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":890},"output_tokens":50,"service_tier